"\n\n\n\n\n## Ordered\n\n\n\n## Review\nA famous gelato shop in Melbourne.  \nIf you have the time, it's definitely worth a visit.\n\n\n\nThere was a queue but it moved faster than expected.\n\nWe ordered a cone with 2 flavors mixed together.  \nThe portion was bigger than expected — honestly, one scoop would have been enough.  \nTwo scoops was too sweet for me.  \nIt was the first time I've ever felt genuinely full from eating gelato.\n## Pictures\n\n\n\n\n\n"